---

BassSanctum is a pack-author dimension: send players in, have them take the configured item off the altar, and send them back.

1. Set the **portal block** in config. Right-click that block to enter the Bass Sanctum dimension.
2. A structure generates with an **altar** in the middle.
3. The item on the altar is whatever you declared in config (often a boss summon).

The altar model is a placeholder. If you are a resource-pack or addon author, you can replace it with something better.
